{
 "id": "7d2c4d5b-da23-4d5a-befd-17623bf4402d",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Yarinaoshi Seirei Hime wa Kago Nashi Ouji no Chouhi wo Mezasu Shinitakunai no de Kekkon shimasu!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "やり直し精霊姫は加護なし皇子の寵妃を目指す　死にたくないので結婚します！"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Shinlu, a princess of the spirit clan, is trapped in a cycle of death and rebirth—each time dying from a mysterious plague that wipes out her people, only to return to her 18th birthday. Now in her third life, she is determined to save her clan. But there’s one major problem—her kingdom lacks the funds to research a cure!\n\nWhile struggling to find a solution, she learns that Prince Shang, the fifth prince of a powerful empire, is in need of a spouse. However, he is doomed to be falsely accused of treason and executed…\n\nSeeing an opportunity, Shinlu boldly decides, “If I marry the prince, I’ll get a dowry!” And so, she takes Shang as her husband—setting the stage for a fateful alliance.\n\nThis time, she vows to create a future where everyone can be happy! A Chinese-inspired romantic fantasy featuring a time-looping princess and a prince with a troubled past!\n\n(The digital edition includes the bonus short story, \"A Moment with My Husband.\")",
   "ja": "一族を滅亡させる謎の病で死んでは十八歳の誕生日に戻り、人生三周目の精霊族の姫・心如（シンルー）。一族を救いたいのに、国には薬を研究するお金がない！　資金繰りに悩んでいると、大国の第五皇子・聖（シャン）の婿入り先が探されているとの話を耳にする。彼は反逆罪の濡れ衣を着せられ処刑される運命なのだが……。心如は「皇子様を婿に迎えれば持参金が入る！」と聖と結婚することを決め――!?　今生こそ、皆で幸せになりましょう！　死に戻り姫と訳あり皇子の中華風ラブファンタジー！　※電子版はショートストーリー『婿様と過ごすひととき』付。"
  },
